an class=\"block w-6 h-0.5 bg-white transition-all duration-300 \"></span><span class=\"block w-6 h-0.5 bg-white transition-all duration-300 \"></span></button></div></div></nav><main><section class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[91vh] max-[380px]:px-4 p-8 py-12 bg-[url(&#x27;/images/rn-infotech-10.webp&#x27;)] bg-cover bg-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col h-full justify-center\"><div class=\"h-[91vh] absolute inset-0 bg-black/70\"></div> <div class=\"h-full relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 md:gap-6\"><h1 class=\"flex justify-center items-center font-serif text-color-herotext max-[380px]:text-xl text-[25px] pt-25 sm:text-5xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-4xl 2xl:text-6xl text-center sm:w-4/5 max-[380px]:leading-10 leading-12 md:leading-16 lg:leading-18 xl:leading-18 2xl:leading-28\">PROFESSIONAL LAPTOP REPAIR &amp; REFURBISHED LAPTOPS IN GRANT ROAD</h1><p class=\"max-[450px]:mt-[-5px] mt-[-20px] mb-[15px] font-sans max-[380px]:w-full w-[90%] max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-2xl leading-6 max-[380px]:leading-5 md:leading-7 2xl:leading-8 sm:w-4/5 md:w-3/5 text-center text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl xl:text-xl text-white\">Serving Mumbai since 1990, RN Infotech provides expert diagnostics, genuine parts, and customer-first computer repair solutions.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 md:gap-5\"><a href=\"/services\"><button class=\"w-[214px] cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">View Services</button></a><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"border border-light-blue cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-secondary hover:bg-[#00234c] text-light-blue rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Talk to a Technician</button></a></div></div></div></section><div class=\" font-bitcount w-full overflow-hidden bg-gray-800 py-4 md:py-4 border-y border-dotted border-blue-300 group\"><div class=\"flex animate-marquee whitespace-nowrap group-hover:[animation-play-state:paused]\" style=\"width:max-content\"><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Expert Laptop Repair &amp; Services in Mumbai — Fast, Reliable &amp; Affordable!</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Business Hours: Mon–Sat 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM | Sunday: By Appointment Only</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Quality Second-Hand Laptops Available — Tested, Trusted &amp; Budget Friendly!</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Home Service Available — We Come to You! Standard Visiting Charges Apply.</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Visit Us at Tara Temple Lane, Grant Road, Mumbai — Serving Mumbai Since 1990!</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Expert Laptop Repair &amp; Services in Mumbai — Fast, Reliable &amp; Affordable!</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Business Hours: Mon–Sat 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM | Sunday: By Appointment Only</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Quality Second-Hand Laptops Available — Tested, Trusted &amp; Budget Friendly!</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Home Service Available — We Come to You! Standard Visiting Charges Apply.</span><span class=\" text-shadow-[0_0_10px] text-shadow-blue-500  text-xl md:text-2xl font-normal text-blue-200 mx-6 md:mx-10\">Visit Us at Tara Temple Lane, Grant Road, Mumbai — Serving Mumbai Since 1990!</span></div></div><section class=\"py-8 px-6 sm:px-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16 2xl:px-35 min-h-[600px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 mb-8 md:mb-10\"><div class=\"h-6 w-32 bg-gray-200 rounded animate-pulse\"></div><div class=\"h-10 w-48 bg-gray-200 rounded animate-pulse\"></div><div class=\"h-6 w-96 bg-gray-200 rounded animate-pulse\"></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"h-[420px] bg-gray-200 rounded-2xl animate-pulse\"></div><div class=\"h-[420px] bg-gray-200 rounded-2xl animate-pulse\"></div><div class=\"h-[420px] bg-gray-200 rounded-2xl animate-pulse\"></div><div class=\"h-[420px] bg-gray-200 rounded-2xl animate-pulse\"></div><div class=\"h-[420px] bg-gray-200 rounded-2xl animate-pulse\"></div><div class=\"h-[420px] bg-gray-200 rounded-2xl animate-pulse\"></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-section-bg py-8 px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 lg:py-12 xl:px-30 2xl:px-50\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12 lg:gap-10 items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center w-full\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><p class=\"label font-semibold\">Who We Are</p><h2 class=\"max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 font-serif sm:text-3xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl normal-case\">About RN Infotech</h2></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-3 lg:gap-10 xl:gap-16 w-full\"><div class=\"relative w-full lg:w-1/2 h-[260px] sm:max-lg:h-[370px] sm:max-lg:w-[90%] lg:h-[400px] xl:h-[460px] flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-[72%] h-[95%] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md\"><img alt=\"About background\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"positi