Established in 1990, RN Infotech is one of Mumbai&#x27;s leading names in laptop repair and computer services. Located at Tara Temple Lane, Grant Road, we have been serving customers from across Mumbai for over three decades — building trust, one repair at a time. We are a one-stop destination for all your laptop needs — whether it&#x27;s a quick fix, a spare part, or an affordable second-hand laptop. Our dedicated team of skilled technicians and courteous staff ensure that every customer walks away satisfied.</p><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"undefined cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Contact Us</button></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#f6f8fd] bg-[url(&#x27;/images/sec-bg.webp&#x27;)] bg-cover shadow-[inset_0_20px_60px_-10px_#00000026] px-8 py-14 lg:py-18 lg:px-16 2xl:px-50\"><div class=\"h-full\"><div class=\"flex gap-8 md:gap-10 flex-col items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 justify-center items-center\"><p class=\"label font-semibold\">Why Us</p><h2 class=\"max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl  font-serif sm:text-3xl text-center max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">Why Choose RN Infotech?</h2></div><div class=\"w-full flex flex-col xl:flex-row gap-5 justify-between\"><div class=\"shadow-lg shadow-gray-300 transition-transform duration-600 hover:-translate-y-2 w-full xl:w-1/3 p-4 pb-6 bg-white rounded-2xl flex items-start gap-4 border border-gray-300\"><div class=\"bg-primary rounded-xl p-3 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center\"><img alt=\"Laptop Repair Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"icon-color md:w-[40px] md:h-[40px]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fworkspace_premiu.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_ne