ext-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-5 flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex gap-1 w-fit\"><img alt=\"star\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"color-review-star md:w-[20px] md:h-[20px]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"star\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"color-review-star md:w-[20px] md:h-[20px]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"star\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"color-review-star md:w-[20px] md:h-[20px]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"star\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"color-review-star md:w-[20px] md:h-[20px]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"star\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"color-review-star md:w-[20px] md:h-[20px]\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Freviews-star.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/></div><p class=\"w-full sm:w-[85%] text-lg md:text-base\">&quot;Trustworthy and professional service. I was worried about giving my laptop for repair but RN Infotech made the whole process smooth and stress-free.&quot;</p><p class=\"font-bold text-lg md:text-base\">- <!-- -->Pooja Nair, Chembur</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:gap-4 justify-center items-center\"><a href=\"/services\"><button class=\"undefined cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">View Services</button></a><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"undefined cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-secondary hover:bg-[#00234c] text-light-blue rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Contact Us</button></a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gray-50 max-[380px]:px-5 p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16 2xl:px-50\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center\"><p class=\"label font-semibold\">? FAQs</p><h2 class=\"italic max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl  font-serif sm:text-3xl text-center max-[380px]:leading-11 leading-14\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-12 w-full items-start\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">How long will it take to repair my laptop?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">It generally takes 2 to 3 business days to repair a laptop. However, the exact time may vary depending on the issue. We recommend discussing the service time before dropping off your device.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Is it safe to give my laptop to RN Infotech for repairs?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Absolutely! RN Infotech is a certified and trusted service centre in Mumbai. Your laptop is handled with the utmost care and professionalism — you can leave it with us without any worries.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">How can I find RN Infotech?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">We are located at Tara Temple Lane, Leamington Road, Grant Road, Mumbai. We are easily accessible by all modes of transport.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Do I need to bring my AC adapter along?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Yes, it is recommended to bring your AC adapter. This helps our technician check the voltage and current, allowing for a more accurate diagnosis of the issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Do you charge extra for home service?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">No, we do not charge additionally for home service. You only need to pay the standard visiting charges. Our technician will come to your doorstep at your convenience.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:block w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[480px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"FAQ Image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center w-full sm:w-auto\"><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"py-1 cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Still Have Questions? Contact Us</button></a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[url(&#x27;/images/rn-infotech-19.webp&#x27;)] flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative min-h-[65vh] min-sm:h-[70vh] md:h-[60vh] lg:min-h-[40vh] xl:min-h-[70vh] bg-cover bg-center max-[380px]:py-15 p-8 py-12 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/70\"></div><div class=\"relative h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center g